            "Unnamed: 5": "No",
            "Unnamed: 6": "CL.C96777.MEDEVAL.RS",
            "Unnamed: 7": 15,
            "Unnamed: 8": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 9": NaN,
            "Unnamed: 10": "RSEVALID [en]",
            "Unnamed: 11": "RSEVALID [CDASH]\nIdentify the evaluator providing this evaluation. [completionInstructions]\nWhen multiple assessors play the role identified in RSEVAL, values of RSEVALID will attribute a row of data to a particular assessor. [implementationNotes]\nMaps directly to the SDTMIG variable listed in the column with the heading SDTMIG Target. [mappingInstructions]\nEvaluator Identifier [prompt]",
